                  <provenance><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_484">Salisbury, Wiltshire. Cathedral
                        church of St Mary the Virgin; see removed from Sherborne in 1078.
                        </orgName><p>The following are listed: a) manuscripts containing evidence,
                        indicated here by sigla or under notes, that they belonged to Salisbury
                        Cathedral Library before 1540; b) MSS. listed in Patrick Young's catalogue
                        made in 1622 or 1623, concerning which there is no reason to suppose that
                        they were added to the Library between 1540 and 1622; c) MSS. which are
                        likely to have been at Salisbury before 1540, but which are not listed in
                        Young's catalogue: these are queried.</p><note
